§§ `Order 6 -- commencing proceedings, the defence and the affidavit`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@export Under Order 6, rule 1, how must I commence proceedings?
GIVEN `these Rules or any written law otherwise provide` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that these Rules or any written law otherwise provide?
      `these Rules or any written law require an originating application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that these Rules or any written law require an originating application?
      `the proceedings concern an application made to the Court under a written law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the proceedings concern an application made to the Court under a written law?
      `the proceedings concern solely or primarily the construction of a written law, instrument or document or a question of law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the proceedings concern solely or primarily the construction of a written law, instrument or document or a question of law?
      `the material facts are in dispute` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the material facts are in dispute?
GIVETH A `o 6 r 1 the mode of commencing proceedings`
DECIDE `Under Order 6, rule 1, how must I commence proceedings` IS
