§§ `Order 12, Rule 3 -- common expert, court expert and number of experts (O. 12, r. 3)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@export Under Order 12, rule 3(1), must the parties agree on one common expert?
GIVEN `paragraph (5) applies to the proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that paragraph (5) applies to the proceedings?
      `it is possible for the parties to agree on one common expert` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that it is possible for the parties to agree on one common expert?
