@export Under Order 12, rule 3(2), may the party rely on expert evidence from more than one expert for the issue?
GIVEN `paragraph (5) applies to the proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that paragraph (5) applies to the proceedings?
      `it is a special case` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that it is a special case?
      `the Court approves` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Court approves?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 12, rule 3(2), may the party rely on expert evidence from more than one expert for the issue` IS
    `o 12 r 3(2) the party may rely on expert evidence from more than one expert for the issue` `paragraph (5) applies to the proceedings` `it is a special case` `the Court approves`

@export Under Order 12, rule 3(5), does paragraph (5) apply to the proceedings?
