§§ `Order 12, Rule 5 -- expert’s report`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@export Under Order 12, rule 5(2), does the expert's report include what paragraph (2) requires?
GIVEN `the report includes the expert's qualifications showing that the expert has the requisite specialised knowledge on the issues referred to the expert` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes the expert's qualifications showing that the expert has the requisite specialised knowledge on the issues referred to the expert?
      `the report includes the expert's statement that the expert understands the duty to assist the Court and that the duty overrides any obligation to the person from whom the expert receives instructions or by whom the expert is paid` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes the expert's statement that the expert understands the duty to assist the Court and that the duty overrides any obligation to the person from whom the expert receives instructions or by whom the expert is paid?
      `the report includes the issues referred to the expert and the common set of agreed or assumed facts that the expert relied on` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes the issues referred to the expert and the common set of agreed or assumed facts that the expert relied on?
      `the report includes a list of the materials that the expert relied on` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes a list of the materials that the expert relied on?
      `the report includes only extracts of the materials which are necessary to understand the report` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes only extracts of the materials which are necessary to understand the report?
      `the materials include tests, experiments or the collection or analysis of data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the materials include tests, experiments or the collection or analysis of data?
      `the report includes the names and qualifications of the persons who did them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes the names and qualifications of the persons who did them?
      `the report states whether they did so under the expert's supervision or guidance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report states whether they did so under the expert's supervision or guidance?
      `there is a range of opinion on the matters dealt with in the report` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that there is a range of opinion on the matters dealt with in the report?
      `the report includes a summary of the range of opinion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes a summary of the range of opinion?
      `the report includes the reasons for the expert's opinion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes the reasons for the expert's opinion?
      `the report includes a statement of belief of correctness of the expert's opinion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes a statement of belief of correctness of the expert's opinion?
      `the report includes the conclusions reached on the issues referred to the expert and the reasons to support the conclusions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report includes the conclusions reached on the issues referred to the expert and the reasons to support the conclusions?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 12, rule 5(2), does the expert's report include what paragraph (2) requires` IS
    `o 12 r 5(2) the expert's report includes what paragraph (2) requires` (`o 12 r 5(2)(a) the report includes the expert's qualifications` `the report includes the expert's qualifications showing that the expert has the requisite specialised knowledge on the issues referred to the expert`) (`o 12 r 5(2)(b) the report includes the expert's statement of the expert's duty` `the report includes the expert's statement that the expert understands the duty to assist the Court and that the duty overrides any obligation to the person from whom the expert receives instructions or by whom the expert is paid`) (`o 12 r 5(2)(c) the report includes the issues and the common set of facts` `the report includes the issues referred to the expert and the common set of agreed or assumed facts that the expert relied on`) (`o 12 r 5(2)(d) the report includes a list of the materials relied on` `the report includes a list of the materials that the expert relied on` `the report includes only extracts of the materials which are necessary to understand the report`) (`o 12 r 5(2)(e) the report includes the names and qualifications of those who did the tests` `the materials include tests, experiments or the collection or analysis of data` `the report includes the names and qualifications of the persons who did them` `the report states whether they did so under the expert's supervision or guidance`) (`o 12 r 5(2)(f) the report includes a summary of the range of opinion and the reasons` `there is a range of opinion on the matters dealt with in the report` `the report includes a summary of the range of opinion` `the report includes the reasons for the expert's opinion`) (`o 12 r 5(2)(g) the report includes a statement of belief of correctness` `the report includes a statement of belief of correctness of the expert's opinion`) (`o 12 r 5(2)(h) the report includes the conclusions and the reasons` `the report includes the conclusions reached on the issues referred to the expert and the reasons to support the conclusions`)

