§ `Order 17 -- Judgments and orders`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

§§ `Order 17, rule 3`

@export Under Order 17, rule 3(3), must I draw up the order?
GIVEN `the party took out the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you took out the application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 17, rule 3(3), must I draw up the order` IS
    `o 17 r 3(3) the party must draw up the order` `the party took out the application`

@export Under Order 17, rule 3(5), did I send the draft of the order to the other solicitors in time?
GIVEN `the date the draft of the order was sent to the solicitors (if any) of all other parties` IS A DATE @desc On what date was the draft of the order sent to the solicitors (if any) of all other parties?
      `the last day for doing this, counted under Order 3, rule 3` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day for doing this act, counted under Order 3, rule 3 of the Rules of Court?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 17, rule 3(5), did I send the draft of the order to the other solicitors in time` IS
    `o 17 r 3(5) the draft is sent in time` `the date the draft of the order was sent to the solicitors (if any) of all other parties` `the last day for doing this, counted under Order 3, rule 3`

@export Under Order 17, rule 3(6), are the other side's solicitors deemed to consent to my draft of the order?
GIVEN `has happened: the date the solicitors responded to the draft with their consent or their amended draft` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has this happened: the solicitors responded to the draft with their consent or their amended draft?
      `date of: the date the solicitors responded to the draft with their consent or their amended draft` IS A DATE @desc On what date did it happen? (Give any date if it has not happened.)
      `the date I am asking about` IS A DATE @desc For which date are you asking?
      `the last day for doing this, counted under Order 3, rule 3` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day for doing this act, counted under Order 3, rule 3 of the Rules of Court?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 17, rule 3(6), are the other side's solicitors deemed to consent to my draft of the order` IS
    `o 17 r 3(6) the solicitors are deemed to consent to the draft` (IF `has happened: the date the solicitors responded to the draft with their consent or their amended draft` THEN JUST `date of: the date the solicitors responded to the draft with their consent or their amended draft` ELSE NOTHING) `the date I am asking about` `the last day for doing this, counted under Order 3, rule 3`

§§ `Order 17, rule 5`

@export Under Order 17, rule 5(2), how much simple interest at 5.33% a year does the money payable under the order carry?
GIVEN `principal` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the principal amount of money payable under the order?
      `the number of years from the date the order is made until the date of payment` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of years from the date the order is made until the date of payment?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under Order 17, rule 5(2), how much simple interest at 5.33% a year does the money payable under the order carry` IS
    `o 17 r 5(2) the simple interest at 5.33% per year from the date the order is made until the date of payment` `principal` `the number of years from the date the order is made until the date of payment`

