      `the lower Court or the appellate Court otherwise orders` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the lower Court or the appellate Court ordered otherwise?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 19, rule 6(3), is interest allowed for the time enforcement was delayed by the appeal` IS
    `o 19 r 6(3) interest is allowed for the time enforcement has been delayed by the appeal` `enforcement has been delayed by the appeal` `the lower Court or the appellate Court otherwise orders`


-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 7 -- powers of the appellate Court`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@export Under Order 19, rule 7(1), may the appellate Court order a party to serve a document on a non-party?
