GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 19, rule 7(1), may the appellate Court order a party to serve a document on a non-party` IS
    `o 19 r 7(1) the appellate Court may order a party to serve a document on a non-party to the appeal` `the document is to be served on a non-party to the appeal`

@export Under Order 19, rule 7(2), may the appellate Court allow or invite me, as a non-party, to give my views?
