      `there are special grounds` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are there special grounds for giving the evidence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 19, rule 7(7), may further evidence be given on the appeal` IS
    `o 19 r 7(7) further evidence may be given` `the evidence relates to matters after the date of the decision appealed against` `there are special grounds`

@export Under Order 19, rule 7(8), is the further evidence adduced as required?
GIVEN `the evidence is adduced in the manner the appellate Court directed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the evidence adduced in the manner the appellate Court directed?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 19, rule 7(8), is the further evidence adduced as required` IS
    `o 19 r 7(8) the further evidence is adduced as required` `the evidence is adduced in the manner the appellate Court directed`


