      `my application was filed and served in time` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you file and serve the application in time?
      `I show good reason for my absence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you show good reason for your absence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 19, rule 8(3), may the Court restore the appeal for rehearing` IS
    `o 19 r 8(3) the Court may restore the appeal for rehearing` `I applied as the absent party` `my application was filed and served in time` `I show good reason for my absence`


