@export Under Order 19, rule 30(5), does my supplemental record of appeal contain what it must?
GIVEN `my supplemental record has the notice of appeal to the Court of Appeal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your supplemental record of appeal contain the notice of appeal to the Court of Appeal?
