    `o 19 r 35(11) a party may apply to the appellate Court to vary or waive the amount of security` `I am a party`

@export Under Order 19, rule 35(12), may the Court order me to give further security for costs of the application?
GIVEN `the order is for further security for costs to be given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the order one for further security for costs to be given?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 19, rule 35(12), may the Court order me to give further security for costs of the application` IS
    `o 19 r 35(12) the appellate Court may order further security for costs to be given` `the order is for further security for costs to be given`

@export Under Order 19, rule 35(13), is my application to strike out a notice of appeal made by summons supported by affidavit?
GIVEN `my application is to strike out a notice of appeal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your application one to strike out a notice of appeal?
      `I made it by summons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make it by summons?
      `the summons is supported by an affidavit stating the grounds of the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the summons supported by an affidavit stating the grounds of the application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
