    `o 19 r 35(14) the summons and the supporting affidavit are filed and served as required` `I filed and served the summons and the supporting affidavit on the parties to the application` `the date I filed the summons and the affidavit` `the date I served the summons and the affidavit` `my last day` NOTHING

@export Under Order 19, rule 35(15), have I filed and served my affidavit in reply to the applicant's affidavit as required?
