    `o 19 r 35(15) the affidavit in reply to the applicant's affidavit is filed and served as required` `I wish to reply to the applicant's affidavit` `I filed and served my affidavit in reply on the applicant and the other parties` `the date I filed my affidavit in reply` `the date I served my affidavit in reply` `my last day` NOTHING

