    `o 19 r 37(1) the period for the written submissions and the bundle of authorities`'s `period length`

@export Under Order 19, rule 37(1), have I filed and served my written submissions and bundle of authorities on the application as required?
GIVEN `these Rules or any other written law otherwise provide` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do other provisions of these Rules or of any other written law provide otherwise?
      `the appellate Court otherwise directs` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the appellate Court directed otherwise?
      `I have written submissions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have written submissions?
      `I filed and served the written submissions and any bundle of authorities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you file and serve the written submissions and any bundle of authorities?
      `the date I filed my submissions` IS A DATE @desc On what date did you file my submissions?
      `the date I served my submissions` IS A DATE @desc On what date did you serve my submissions?
      `my last day` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day the Rules give you for this step? Count it as Order 3, rule 3 directs, and if the Court extended or shortened the time under Order 3, rule 4, give the changed last day.
