    `o 19 r 38(2) the application to vary or discharge is filed and served as required` `my application is to vary or discharge a direction or order of the Registrar under paragraph (1)` `I filed and served it on all parties who have an interest in the appeal` `the date I filed the application` `the date I served the application` `my last day` NOTHING

