GIVEN `the claimant by notice in writing and without permission wholly discontinued the action against the defendant or withdrew a particular claim against the defendant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the claimant by notice in writing and without permission wholly discontinued the action against the defendant or withdrew a particular claim against the defendant? (yes or no)
      `the action is deemed discontinued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the action is deemed discontinued? (yes or no)
      `the Court has otherwise ordered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Court has otherwise ordered? (yes or no)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 21, rule 9(1), as the defendant, am I entitled to the costs incurred to the time of discontinuance` IS
    `o 21 r 9(1) the defendant is entitled to the costs incurred to the time of discontinuance` `the claimant by notice in writing and without permission wholly discontinued the action against the defendant or withdrew a particular claim against the defendant` `the action is deemed discontinued` `the Court has otherwise ordered`

-- layer 1: roc5-o21-general.l4, `o 21 r 9(1) the defendant may sign judgment for the assessed costs`
@export Under Order 21, rule 9(1), as the defendant, may I sign judgment for the assessed costs?
