-- layer 1: roc5-o21-general.l4, `o 21 r 9(2) the claimant is entitled to the costs incurred to the time of receipt of the notice of payment into Court`
@export Under Order 21, rule 9(2), as the claimant who accepted money paid into Court, am I entitled to the costs incurred to the time of receipt of the notice of payment?
GIVEN `the claimant accepts money paid into Court in satisfaction of the cause of action or all the causes of action, or accepts a sum paid in respect of specified causes of action and gives notice that it abandons the others` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the claimant accepts money paid into Court in satisfaction of the cause of action or all the causes of action, or accepts a sum paid in respect of specified causes of action and gives notice that it abandons the others? (yes or no)
      `the Court has otherwise ordered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Court has otherwise ordered? (yes or no)
      `the claimant accepts the money after the trial or hearing has begun` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the claimant accepts the money after the trial or hearing has begun? (yes or no)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 21, rule 9(2), as the claimant who accepted money paid into Court, am I entitled to the costs incurred to the time of receipt of the notice of payment` IS
    `o 21 r 9(2) the claimant is entitled to the costs incurred to the time of receipt of the notice of payment into Court` `the claimant accepts money paid into Court in satisfaction of the cause of action or all the causes of action, or accepts a sum paid in respect of specified causes of action and gives notice that it abandons the others` `the Court has otherwise ordered` `the claimant accepts the money after the trial or hearing has begun`

-- layer 1: roc5-o21-general.l4, `o 21 r 9(2) the claimant may sign judgment for the assessed costs`
