      `the Court has otherwise ordered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Court has otherwise ordered? (yes or no)
      `the claimant accepts the money after the trial or hearing has begun` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the claimant accepts the money after the trial or hearing has begun? (yes or no)
