      `the enforcement applicant undertakes to pay upon request all charges, commissions, expenses and fees incurred by or payable to the Sheriff in complying with the enforcement order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the enforcement applicant undertakes to pay upon request all charges, commissions, expenses and fees incurred by or payable to the Sheriff in complying with the enforcement order? (yes or no)
