§§ `Order 28, rule 15 -- Affidavits in electronic form`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Order 28, rule 15(1).  Calls: o 28 r 15(1) the affidavit may be used to the same extent as a paper affidavit
@export Under Order 28, rule 15(1), may my electronically filed affidavit be used to the same extent as a paper affidavit?
GIVEN `the affidavit is filed in Court using the electronic filing service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the affidavit is filed in Court using the electronic filing service?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 15(1), may my electronically filed affidavit be used to the same extent as a paper affidavit` IS
    `o 28 r 15(1) the affidavit may be used to the same extent as a paper affidavit` `the affidavit is filed in Court using the electronic filing service`

-- Order 28, rule 15(2)(a).  Calls: o 28 r 15(2)(a) the affidavit is sworn or affirmed in the usual way (the duty arises)
@export Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(a), does the duty arise on my facts, so that the affidavit is sworn or affirmed in the usual way?
GIVEN `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(a), does the duty arise on my facts, so that the affidavit is sworn or affirmed in the usual way` IS
    `o 28 r 15(2)(a) the affidavit is sworn or affirmed in the usual way (the duty arises)` `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service`

-- Order 28, rule 15(2)(a).  Calls: o 28 r 15(2)(a) the affidavit is sworn or affirmed in the usual way
@export Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(a), was my affidavit sworn or affirmed in the usual way?
GIVEN `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service?
      `it is sworn or affirmed in the usual way in which the deponent signs the original paper affidavit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that it is sworn or affirmed in the usual way in which the deponent signs the original paper affidavit?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(a), was my affidavit sworn or affirmed in the usual way` IS
    `o 28 r 15(2)(a) the affidavit is sworn or affirmed in the usual way` `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service` `it is sworn or affirmed in the usual way in which the deponent signs the original paper affidavit`

-- Order 28, rule 15(2)(b).  Calls: o 28 r 15(2)(b) a true and complete electronic image of the original is created (the duty arises)
@export Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(b), does the duty arise on my facts, so that a true and complete electronic image of the original is created?
GIVEN `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(b), does the duty arise on my facts, so that a true and complete electronic image of the original is created` IS
    `o 28 r 15(2)(b) a true and complete electronic image of the original is created (the duty arises)` `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service`

-- Order 28, rule 15(2)(b).  Calls: o 28 r 15(2)(b) a true and complete electronic image of the original is created
@export Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(b), have I created a true and complete electronic image of the original affidavit?
GIVEN `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service?
      `a true and complete electronic image of the original paper affidavit is created` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that a true and complete electronic image of the original paper affidavit is created?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(b), have I created a true and complete electronic image of the original affidavit` IS
    `o 28 r 15(2)(b) a true and complete electronic image of the original is created` `the affidavit is to be filed in Court using the electronic filing service` `a true and complete electronic image of the original paper affidavit is created`

-- Order 28, rule 15(2)(c).  Calls: o 28 r 15(2)(c) the original paper affidavit is retained for 7 years
@export Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(c), have I kept the original paper affidavit for the 7 years required?
GIVEN `the year of the date` IS A NUMBER @desc In what year did this happen: the date the party ceased to retain the original? (0 if it has not happened yet)
      `the month of the date` IS A NUMBER @desc In which month did it happen, from 1 for January to 12 for December? (0 if it has not happened yet)
      `the day of the month of the date` IS A NUMBER @desc On which day of the month did it happen? (0 if it has not happened yet)
      `the last day of the 7 years` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day of the 7 years, counted under Order 3, Rule 3?
      `the date I am asking about` IS A DATE @desc For which date are you asking?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 15(2)(c), have I kept the original paper affidavit for the 7 years required` IS
    `o 28 r 15(2)(c) the original paper affidavit is retained for 7 years` (`roc7 seat wiring: the day it was done, from what I know` `the year of the date` `the month of the date` `the day of the month of the date`) `the last day of the 7 years` `the date I am asking about`

-- Order 28, rule 15(3).  Calls: o 28 r 15(3) the Court may permit the electronic image to be used
@export Under Order 28, rule 15(3), may the Court permit my electronic image to be used?
GIVEN `the original paper affidavit became unavailable within 7 years after it was filed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the original paper affidavit became unavailable within 7 years after it was filed?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 15(3), may the Court permit my electronic image to be used` IS
    `o 28 r 15(3) the Court may permit the electronic image to be used` `the original paper affidavit became unavailable within 7 years after it was filed`

