      `there is an inconsistency between the information entered into the electronic template and the information contained in the document` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that there is an inconsistency between the information entered into the electronic template and the information contained in the document?
      `the document is remotely composed on the computer system of the electronic filing service provider` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the document is remotely composed on the computer system of the electronic filing service provider?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 16, does the information contained in my document prevail` IS
    `o 28 r 16 the information contained in the document prevails` `the document was filed using the electronic filing service` `there is an inconsistency between the information entered into the electronic template and the information contained in the document` `the document is remotely composed on the computer system of the electronic filing service provider`

-- Order 28, rule 16.  Calls: o 28 r 16 the information entered into the electronic template prevails
@export Under Order 28, rule 16, does the information entered into the electronic template prevail?
GIVEN `the document was filed using the electronic filing service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the document was filed using the electronic filing service?
      `there is an inconsistency between the information entered into the electronic template and the information contained in the document` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that there is an inconsistency between the information entered into the electronic template and the information contained in the document?
      `the document is remotely composed on the computer system of the electronic filing service provider` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the document is remotely composed on the computer system of the electronic filing service provider?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 28, rule 16, does the information entered into the electronic template prevail` IS
    `o 28 r 16 the information entered into the electronic template prevails` `the document was filed using the electronic filing service` `there is an inconsistency between the information entered into the electronic template and the information contained in the document` `the document is remotely composed on the computer system of the electronic filing service provider`

