§§ `Order 28, rule 17 -- Interpretation, etc.`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Order 28, rule 17(1).  Calls: o 28 r 17(1) a user registered by the Registrar of the Supreme Court is treated as also registered by the other two Registrars
@export Under Order 28, rule 17(1), am I, registered with the Registrar of the Supreme Court, treated as also registered with the other two Registrars?
