DECIDE `Under Order 29A, rule 2(2), does the duty arise on my facts, so that the application is made by summons` IS
    `o 29A r 2(2) the application is made by summons (the duty arises)` `the application is under paragraph (1)`

-- Order 29A, rule 2(2).  Calls: o 29A r 2(2) the application is made by summons
