§§ `Order 29A, rule 3 -- Request for opinion on question of foreign law and for clarification`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Order 29A, rule 3(1).  Calls: o 29A r 3(1) the initial request states what it must state (the duty arises)
@export Under Order 29A, rule 3(1), does the duty arise on my facts, so that the initial request states what it must state?
