DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 6, may the Court discharge the warrant because property under my caveat was arrested` IS
    `o 33 r 6 the Court may discharge the warrant` `property with respect to which a caveat against arrest is in force is arrested in pursuance of a warrant of arrest` `the party at whose instance the caveat was entered applies to the Court by summons` `the Court is not satisfied that the party procuring the arrest had a good and sufficient reason for so doing` `the Court orders the warrant discharged`

-- Order 33, rule 6.  Calls: o 33 r 6 the Court may order the party procuring the arrest to pay damages
