      `the month the endorsement was made` IS A NUMBER @desc In which month was it made, from 1 for January to 12 for December? (0 if it has not been made)
      `the day of the month the endorsement was made` IS A NUMBER @desc On which day of the month was it made? (0 if it has not been made)
      `the year the defendant filed the notice` IS A NUMBER @desc In what year did the defendant file the notice of intention to contest or not contest? (0 if the defendant has not filed one)
      `the month the defendant filed the notice` IS A NUMBER @desc In which month did the defendant file it, from 1 for January to 12 for December? (0 if not filed)
      `the day of the month the defendant filed the notice` IS A NUMBER @desc On which day of the month did the defendant file it? (0 if not filed)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 7(3), on what day is the originating claim deemed duly served on the defendant` IS
    `o 33 r 7(3) the day the originating claim is deemed duly served` (`roc7 seat wiring: the day it was done, from what I know` `the year the endorsement was made` `the month the endorsement was made` `the day of the month the endorsement was made`) (`roc7 seat wiring: the day it was done, from what I know` `the year the defendant filed the notice` `the month the defendant filed the notice` `the day of the month the defendant filed the notice`)

