    `o 33 r 7(3)(a) the originating claim is deemed duly served on acceptance by the defendant's solicitor` `the defendant’s solicitor endorses on the originating claim a statement that he or she accepts service of the originating claim on behalf of the defendant`

-- Order 33, rule 7(3)(b).  Calls: o 33 r 7(3)(b) the originating claim is deemed duly served when the defendant files the notice
