-- Order 33, rule 7(12).  Calls: o 33 r 7(12) permission of the Court is required for the amendment
@export Under Order 33, rule 7(12), is the permission of the Court required for my amendment?
GIVEN `the amendment consists of the addition, omission or substitution of a party to the action or an alteration of the capacity in which a party to the action sues or is sued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the amendment consists of the addition, omission or substitution of a party to the action or an alteration of the capacity in which a party to the action sues or is sued?
