      `the amendment consists of an amendment of the statement of claim (if any) endorsed on the originating claim` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the amendment consists of an amendment of the statement of claim (if any) endorsed on the originating claim?
      `the amendment is made before service of the originating claim on any party to the action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the amendment is made before service of the originating claim on any party to the action?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
