    `o 33 r 7(12) permission of the Court is required for the amendment` `the amendment consists of the addition, omission or substitution of a party to the action or an alteration of the capacity in which a party to the action sues or is sued` `the amendment consists of the addition or substitution of a new cause of action` `the amendment consists of an amendment of the statement of claim (if any) endorsed on the originating claim` `the amendment is made before service of the originating claim on any party to the action`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Order 33, rule 8 -- Committal of solicitor failing to comply with undertaking`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Order 33, rule 8.  Calls: o 33 r 8 the solicitor is liable to committal
@export Under Order 33, rule 8, is a solicitor who failed to comply with an undertaking liable to committal?
GIVEN `the solicitor is the solicitor of a party to an action in rem` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the solicitor is the solicitor of a party to an action in rem?
      `the solicitor fails to comply with a written undertaking by the solicitor to any other party or that other party’s solicitor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the solicitor fails to comply with a written undertaking by the solicitor to any other party or that other party’s solicitor?
      `the undertaking is to file and serve a notice of intention to contest or not contest in the action, give bail or pay money into Court in lieu of bail` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the undertaking is to file and serve a notice of intention to contest or not contest in the action, give bail or pay money into Court in lieu of bail?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 8, is a solicitor who failed to comply with an undertaking liable to committal` IS
    `o 33 r 8 the solicitor is liable to committal` `the solicitor is the solicitor of a party to an action in rem` `the solicitor fails to comply with a written undertaking by the solicitor to any other party or that other party’s solicitor` `the undertaking is to file and serve a notice of intention to contest or not contest in the action, give bail or pay money into Court in lieu of bail`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Order 33, rule 9 -- Execution, etc., of warrant of arrest`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Order 33, rule 9(1).  Calls: o 33 r 9(1) the warrant of arrest is valid on the date
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(1), is the warrant of arrest still valid on the date I am asking about?
GIVEN `the last day of the validity` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day of the validity, counted under Order 3, Rule 3?
      `the date I am asking about` IS A DATE @desc For which date are you asking?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(1), is the warrant of arrest still valid on the date I am asking about` IS
    `o 33 r 9(1) the warrant of arrest is valid on the date` `the last day of the validity` `the date I am asking about`

-- Order 33, rule 9(2).  Calls: o 33 r 9(2) the warrant may be executed by the Sheriff or a notified solicitor or clerk
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(2), may this person execute the warrant of arrest?
GIVEN `the person executing is the Sheriff, or a solicitor or a solicitor’s clerk whose name and particulars have been notified to the Registrar for this purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person executing is the Sheriff, or a solicitor or a solicitor’s clerk whose name and particulars have been notified to the Registrar for this purpose?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(2), may this person execute the warrant of arrest` IS
    `o 33 r 9(2) the warrant may be executed by the Sheriff or a notified solicitor or clerk` `the person executing is the Sheriff, or a solicitor or a solicitor’s clerk whose name and particulars have been notified to the Registrar for this purpose`

-- Order 33, rule 9(4).  Calls: o 33 r 9(4) the warrant of arrest cannot yet be executed by the Sheriff for want of the undertaking
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(4), can the warrant of arrest not yet be executed by the Sheriff for want of the undertaking?
GIVEN `the person executing is the Sheriff or the Sheriff's officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person executing is the Sheriff or the Sheriff's officer?
      `an undertaking in writing satisfactory to the Sheriff to pay the fees and expenses of the Sheriff has been lodged in the Sheriff's office by the party requesting the execution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that an undertaking in writing satisfactory to the Sheriff to pay the fees and expenses of the Sheriff has been lodged in the Sheriff's office by the party requesting the execution?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(4), can the warrant of arrest not yet be executed by the Sheriff for want of the undertaking` IS
    `o 33 r 9(4) the warrant of arrest cannot yet be executed by the Sheriff for want of the undertaking` `the person executing is the Sheriff or the Sheriff's officer` `an undertaking in writing satisfactory to the Sheriff to pay the fees and expenses of the Sheriff has been lodged in the Sheriff's office by the party requesting the execution`

-- Order 33, rule 9(5).  Calls: o 33 r 9(5) the warrant of arrest may be executed
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(5), may the warrant of arrest be executed after I lodged a written request that it not be?
GIVEN `the party at whose instance the warrant was issued has lodged a written request with the Sheriff that it not be executed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the party at whose instance the warrant was issued has lodged a written request with the Sheriff that it not be executed?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(5), may the warrant of arrest be executed after I lodged a written request that it not be` IS
    `o 33 r 9(5) the warrant of arrest may be executed` `the party at whose instance the warrant was issued has lodged a written request with the Sheriff that it not be executed`

-- Order 33, rule 9(6).  Calls: o 33 r 9(6) a warrant issued against freight may be executed by serving it on the cargo or the ship or both
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(6), may a warrant issued against freight be executed by serving it on the cargo or the ship?
GIVEN `the warrant of arrest is issued against freight` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the warrant of arrest is issued against freight?
      `the warrant is served on the cargo in respect of which the freight is payable, or on the ship in which that cargo was carried, or on both of them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the warrant is served on the cargo in respect of which the freight is payable, or on the ship in which that cargo was carried, or on both of them?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(6), may a warrant issued against freight be executed by serving it on the cargo or the ship` IS
    `o 33 r 9(6) a warrant issued against freight may be executed by serving it on the cargo or the ship or both` `the warrant of arrest is issued against freight` `the warrant is served on the cargo in respect of which the freight is payable, or on the ship in which that cargo was carried, or on both of them`

-- Order 33, rule 9(7).  Calls: o 33 r 9(7) the warrant of arrest is served on the property against which it is issued (the duty arises)
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(7), does the duty arise on my facts, so that the warrant of arrest is served on the property against which it is issued?
GIVEN `the warrant of arrest has been issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the warrant of arrest has been issued?
      `neither paragraph (6) nor Rule 11 applies to the service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that neither paragraph (6) nor Rule 11 applies to the service?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(7), does the duty arise on my facts, so that the warrant of arrest is served on the property against which it is issued` IS
    `o 33 r 9(7) the warrant of arrest is served on the property against which it is issued (the duty arises)` `the warrant of arrest has been issued` `neither paragraph (6) nor Rule 11 applies to the service`

-- Order 33, rule 9(7).  Calls: o 33 r 9(7) the warrant of arrest is served on the property against which it is issued
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(7), has the warrant of arrest been served on the property against which it is issued?
GIVEN `the warrant of arrest has been issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the warrant of arrest has been issued?
      `neither paragraph (6) nor Rule 11 applies to the service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that neither paragraph (6) nor Rule 11 applies to the service?
      `the warrant is served on the property against which it is issued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the warrant is served on the property against which it is issued?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(7), has the warrant of arrest been served on the property against which it is issued` IS
    `o 33 r 9(7) the warrant of arrest is served on the property against which it is issued` `the warrant of arrest has been issued` `neither paragraph (6) nor Rule 11 applies to the service` `the warrant is served on the property against which it is issued`

-- Order 33, rule 9(8).  Calls: o 33 r 9(8) the report of the arrest is made by the person required (the duty arises)
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(8), must the report of the arrest be made?
GIVEN `a warrant of arrest has been served` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that a warrant of arrest has been served?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(8), must the report of the arrest be made` IS
    `o 33 r 9(8) the report of the arrest is made by the person required (the duty arises)` `a warrant of arrest has been served`

-- Order 33, rule 9(8).  Calls: o 33 r 9(8) the report of the arrest is made by the person required
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(8), has the report of the arrest been made by the person required?
GIVEN `a warrant of arrest has been served` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that a warrant of arrest has been served?
      `the warrant of arrest was executed by a solicitor or a solicitor's clerk` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the warrant of arrest was executed by a solicitor or a solicitor's clerk?
      `the report of the arrest is made by the solicitor or solicitor's clerk for the Sheriff` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report of the arrest is made by the solicitor or solicitor's clerk for the Sheriff?
      `the report of the arrest is made by the Sheriff` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the report of the arrest is made by the Sheriff?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(8), has the report of the arrest been made by the person required` IS
    `o 33 r 9(8) the report of the arrest is made by the person required` `a warrant of arrest has been served` `the warrant of arrest was executed by a solicitor or a solicitor's clerk` `the report of the arrest is made by the solicitor or solicitor's clerk for the Sheriff` `the report of the arrest is made by the Sheriff`

-- Order 33, rule 9(8).  Calls: o 33 r 9(8) the report of the arrest is made in time
@export Under Order 33, rule 9(8), was the report of the arrest made in time?
GIVEN `the year it was done` IS A NUMBER @desc In what year was it done? (0 if it has not been done yet)
      `the month it was done` IS A NUMBER @desc In which month was it done, from 1 for January to 12 for December? (0 if it has not been done yet)
      `the day of the month it was done` IS A NUMBER @desc On which day of the month was it done? (0 if it has not been done yet)
      `the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day for doing the act, counted under Order 3, Rule 3?
      `the date I am asking about` IS A DATE @desc For which date are you asking?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 9(8), was the report of the arrest made in time` IS
    `o 33 r 9(8) the report of the arrest is made in time` (`roc7 seat wiring: the day it was done, from what I know` `the year it was done` `the month it was done` `the day of the month it was done`) `the last day for doing the act` `the date I am asking about`

