§§ `Order 33, rule 12 -- Applications with respect to property under arrest`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Order 33, rule 12(2).  Calls: o 33 r 12(2) the Sheriff must send the person a copy of the order (the duty arises)
