    `o 33 r 12(2) the Sheriff must send the person a copy of the order (the duty arises)` `an order has been made on an application under paragraph (1)`

-- Order 33, rule 12(2).  Calls: o 33 r 12(2) the Sheriff must send the person a copy of the order
@export Under Order 33, rule 12(2), will the Sheriff send me a copy of the order?
GIVEN `an order has been made on an application under paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that an order has been made on an application under paragraph (1)?
      `the person has entered a caveat which is still in force` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person has entered a caveat which is still in force?
      `the person has caused a warrant for the arrest of the property to be executed by the Sheriff` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person has caused a warrant for the arrest of the property to be executed by the Sheriff?
      `the person has filed and served a notice of intention to contest or not contest in any action in which the property is under arrest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person has filed and served a notice of intention to contest or not contest in any action in which the property is under arrest?
      `the person has intervened in any action in which the property is under arrest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person has intervened in any action in which the property is under arrest?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 12(2), will the Sheriff send me a copy of the order` IS
    `o 33 r 12(2) the Sheriff must send the person a copy of the order` `an order has been made on an application under paragraph (1)` `the person has entered a caveat which is still in force` `the person has caused a warrant for the arrest of the property to be executed by the Sheriff` `the person has filed and served a notice of intention to contest or not contest in any action in which the property is under arrest` `the person has intervened in any action in which the property is under arrest`

-- Order 33, rule 12(3).  Calls: o 33 r 12(3) the summons and copies of affidavits are served on the Sheriff and the persons referred to in paragraph (2) (the duty arises)
@export Under Order 33, rule 12(3), must my summons and affidavits be served on the Sheriff and the persons in paragraph (2)?
GIVEN `the person making the application is a person other than the Sheriff` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person making the application is a person other than the Sheriff?
      `the Court has not otherwise ordered on an application made by summons without notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Court has not otherwise ordered on an application made by summons without notice?
