DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 12(3), must my summons and affidavits be served on the Sheriff and the persons in paragraph (2)` IS
    `o 33 r 12(3) the summons and copies of affidavits are served on the Sheriff and the persons referred to in paragraph (2) (the duty arises)` `the person making the application is a person other than the Sheriff` `the Court has not otherwise ordered on an application made by summons without notice`

-- Order 33, rule 12(3).  Calls: o 33 r 12(3) the summons and copies of affidavits are served on the Sheriff and the persons referred to in paragraph (2)
@export Under Order 33, rule 12(3), has this been done: the summons and copies of affidavits are served on the Sheriff and the persons referred to in paragraph (2)?
GIVEN `the person making the application is a person other than the Sheriff` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person making the application is a person other than the Sheriff?
      `the Court has not otherwise ordered on an application made by summons without notice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the Court has not otherwise ordered on an application made by summons without notice?
      `the application is made by summons in the action in which the property is under arrest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the application is made by summons in the action in which the property is under arrest?
      `the summons together with copies of any affidavits in support is served upon the Sheriff and all persons referred to in paragraph (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the summons together with copies of any affidavits in support is served upon the Sheriff and all persons referred to in paragraph (2)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 33, rule 12(3), has this been done: the summons and copies of affidavits are served on the Sheriff and the persons referred to in paragraph (2)` IS
    `o 33 r 12(3) the summons and copies of affidavits are served on the Sheriff and the persons referred to in paragraph (2)` `the person making the application is a person other than the Sheriff` `the Court has not otherwise ordered on an application made by summons without notice` `the application is made by summons in the action in which the property is under arrest` `the summons together with copies of any affidavits in support is served upon the Sheriff and all persons referred to in paragraph (2)`

