    `o 33 r 19(2) the claimant may enter judgment against a defendant in default in an action in personam` `the action is an action mentioned in Rule 18(1) and is an action in personam` `a defendant fails to file a preliminary act within the prescribed period` `the claimant has filed a preliminary act` `entry of judgment is permitted by Order 59, Rule 7` `the claimant enters judgment against that defendant in accordance with Order 6, Rule 7(7) as the circumstances of the case require`

