-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Order 34 -- arbitral proceedings: how and to whom I apply (Rules 2 and 3)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@export Under Order 34, rule 2(1), must I make my application by originating application?
GIVEN `kind` IS A `o 34 r 2 kind of application` @desc Which of these applies? (kind of application)
      `the application is made to a Judge` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true in your case that the application is made to a Judge?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 34, rule 2(1), must I make my application by originating application` IS
    `o 34 r 2(1) the application must be made by originating application` `kind` `the application is made to a Judge`

@export Under Order 34, rule 2(2), must my appeal on a question of law be made by originating application?
GIVEN `kind` IS A `o 34 r 2 kind of application` @desc Which of these applies? (kind of application)
      `all the other parties to the arbitral proceedings agree to the appeal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true in your case that all the other parties to the arbitral proceedings agree to the appeal?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
