    `o 34 r 6(3) the Case and the core bundle are served in time` `the date the appellant's Case was served on the respondent` `the date the core bundle was served on the respondent` `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`

@export Under Order 34, rule 6(4), does my Case have the required content?
GIVEN `my answer: o 34 r 6(4)(a) it contains a statement in numbered paragraphs of each ground on which it is sought to contend that the tribunal erred in law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it contains a statement in numbered paragraphs of each ground on which it is sought to contend that the tribunal erred in law?
      `my answer: o 34 r 6(4)(b) it makes references to the paragraph or passage of the award where each alleged error is to be found` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it makes references to the paragraph or passage of the award where each alleged error is to be found?
