      `my answer: o 34 r 13(a) it exhibits the original order or direction made by the arbitral tribunal sought to be enforced` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it exhibits the original order or direction made by the arbitral tribunal sought to be enforced?
      `my answer: o 34 r 13(b) it states the provisions of the Act or the applicable rules adopted in the arbitration on which the applicant relies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it states the provisions of the Act or the applicable rules adopted in the arbitration on which the applicant relies?
