@export Under Order 34, rule 14(1), does my affidavit supporting the application to enforce an award have the required content?
GIVEN `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(a) it exhibits the arbitration agreement or any record of the content of the arbitration agreement (the original or a copy)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it exhibits the arbitration agreement or any record of the content of the arbitration agreement (the original or a copy)?
      `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(a) it exhibits the original award or a copy of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it exhibits the original award or a copy of it?
      `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the creditor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the creditor?
      `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the debtor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the debtor?
      `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(c) it states either that the award has not been complied with or the extent to which it has not been complied with at the date of the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this true of your document: it states either that the award has not been complied with or the extent to which it has not been complied with at the date of the application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 34, rule 14(1), does my affidavit supporting the application to enforce an award have the required content` IS
    `o 34 r 14(1) the affidavit has the required content` (`o 34 r 14(1) affidavit supporting the application for permission to enforce an award from my answers` `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(a) it exhibits the arbitration agreement or any record of the content of the arbitration agreement (the original or a copy)` `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(a) it exhibits the original award or a copy of it` `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the creditor` `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the debtor` `my answer: o 34 r 14(1)(c) it states either that the award has not been complied with or the extent to which it has not been complied with at the date of the application`)

