    (`o 34 r 14(4) the period for the debtor to apply to set aside the order`'s `period length`)

@export Under Order 34, rule 14(4), did the debtor apply to set aside the order in time?
GIVEN `the order is to be served out of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true in your case that the order is to be served out of Singapore?
