DECIDE `Under Order 34, rule 14(4), did the debtor apply to set aside the order in time` IS
    `o 34 r 14(4) the debtor's application to set aside the order is made in time` `the order is to be served out of Singapore` `the date the debtor applied to set aside the order` `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` (IF `has the Court fixed or allowed a date for: the last day of such other period as the Court has fixed` THEN JUST `the date fixed or allowed for: the last day of such other period as the Court has fixed` ELSE NOTHING)

@export Under Order 34, rule 14(4), is the award still barred from being enforced?
