    `o 39 r 9(2) the Court may order the issue to be tried as an issue in an action may be tried` `the issue is between the Commission and the party who provided the Commitment or against whom the Direction or Decision has been made` `the issue is between the party who has obtained a Decision and the party against whom a Decision has been made`

