    `o 40 r 1(3) the application is made in the way the Rule requires` `an action is pending` (`Under Orders 39 to 45, my choice for o 40 r 1(3) how the application is made` `how the application is made`)

§§ `Order 40, rule 2 -- Application for confiscation order`

-- o 40 r 2(4) the person to be served has been served
