            `o 40 r 6(4)(a) copies of the order and supporting affidavit are served on the defendant` IS `copies of the order and supporting affidavit are served on the defendant`
            `o 40 r 6(4)(a) where the property is held by another person, copies are served on that person` IS (`Under Orders 39 to 45, my choice for o 40 r 2(1) a statement may be required` `where the property is held by another person, copies are served on that person`)
            `o 40 r 6(4)(b) a copy of the order is served on the Accountant-General or a company, as is appropriate` IS `a copy of the order is served on the Accountant-General or a company, as is appropriate`

