-- o 40 r 7(2) the summons and any supporting affidavit are filed and served as the Rule requires
@export Under Order 40, rule 7(2), is it so that the summons and any supporting affidavit are filed and served as the Rule requires?
GIVEN `the summons and any supporting affidavit are filed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the summons and any supporting affidavit are filed? (yes or no)
      `the moment the document is deemed filed (the day)` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the document deemed filed, under Order 28, Rule 10?
      `the moment the document is deemed filed (the hour, 0 to 23)` IS A NUMBER @desc At what hour of that day (0 to 23) is the document deemed filed?
      `the moment the document is deemed filed (the minute, 0 to 59)` IS A NUMBER @desc At what minute past that hour (0 to 59) is the document deemed filed?
      `the day service is deemed effected` IS A DATE @desc On what day is service deemed effected, under Order 7, Rule 8?
      `the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day for doing this act, counted as Order 3, Rule 3 requires?
      `service on the Public Prosecutor` IS A `Under Order 40, rule 2(4): service on a person` @desc the persons to be served: which of these applies to service on the Public Prosecutor?
      `service on the defendant where the defendant is not the applicant` IS A `Under Order 40, rule 2(4): service on a person` @desc the persons to be served: which of these applies to service on the defendant where the defendant is not the applicant?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 40, rule 7(2), is it so that the summons and any supporting affidavit are filed and served as the Rule requires` IS
    `o 40 r 7(2) the summons and any supporting affidavit are filed and served as the Rule requires` `the summons and any supporting affidavit are filed` (`Under Orders 39 to 45, my moment from a day and a time` `the moment the document is deemed filed (the day)` `the moment the document is deemed filed (the hour, 0 to 23)` `the moment the document is deemed filed (the minute, 0 to 59)`) `the day service is deemed effected` `the last day for doing the act` `the persons to be served as the Rule needs it`
    WHERE
        `the persons to be served as the Rule needs it` MEANS `o 40 r 7(2) the persons to be served` WITH
            `o 40 r 7(2)(a) service on the Public Prosecutor` IS (`Under Orders 39 to 45, my choice for o 40 r 2(4) service on a person` `service on the Public Prosecutor`)
            `o 40 r 7(2)(b) service on the defendant where the defendant is not the applicant` IS (`Under Orders 39 to 45, my choice for o 40 r 2(4) service on a person` `service on the defendant where the defendant is not the applicant`)

