    `o 40 r 11(3) the supporting affidavit states what the Rule requires` `what the supporting affidavit states as the Rule needs it`
    WHERE
        `what the supporting affidavit states as the Rule needs it` MEANS `o 40 r 11(3) what the supporting affidavit states` WITH
            `o 40 r 11(3)(a) that the defendant is convicted, or is by reason of section 26 taken to be convicted, of a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence)` IS `that the defendant is convicted, or is by reason of section 26 taken to be convicted, of a drug dealing offence or a serious offence (giving particulars of the offence)`
            `o 40 r 11(3)(b) that the defendant had used or intended to use an instrumentality (giving particulars of the instrumentality) for the commission of the offence` IS `that the defendant had used or intended to use an instrumentality (giving particulars of the instrumentality) for the commission of the offence`
            `o 40 r 11(3)(c) that the instrumentality is not available for forfeiture` IS `that the instrumentality is not available for forfeiture`
