            `o 40 r 11(3)(e) the value of the instrumentality at the time the offence was committed` IS `the value of the instrumentality at the time the offence was committed`
            `o 40 r 11(3)(f) full particulars of the realisable property in respect of which the order is sought, and the person or persons who (to the best of the deponent's knowledge) hold the property` IS `full particulars of the realisable property in respect of which the order is sought, and the person or persons who (to the best of the deponent's knowledge) hold the property`
            `o 40 r 11(3)(g) the amount to be recovered under the substitute property confiscation order` IS `the amount to be recovered under the substitute property confiscation order`

