GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 40, rule 15(4), is it so that the Court may exercise the power conferred by section 20(1) read with section 29C(1) to direct payments by the receiver` IS
    `o 40 r 15(4) the Court may exercise the power conferred by section 20(1) read with section 29C(1) to direct payments by the receiver` `the application is an application under section 19 read with section 29C(1)`

