      `the full name and address of the judgment debtor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the affidavit states: is it true that the full name and address of the judgment debtor? (yes or no)
      `the date and particulars of the order for payment in respect of which default has been made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the affidavit states: is it true that the date and particulars of the order for payment in respect of which default has been made? (yes or no)
      `the total amount which has been paid since the date of the order for payment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the affidavit states: is it true that the total amount which has been paid since the date of the order for payment? (yes or no)
      `the sum or instalment in respect of which default has been made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the affidavit states: is it true that the sum or instalment in respect of which default has been made? (yes or no)
      `the date on which the same ought to have been paid according to the order for payment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the affidavit states: is it true that the date on which the same ought to have been paid according to the order for payment? (yes or no)
      `the debtor's occupation, circumstances and means of payment as they are known to the applicant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the affidavit states: is it true that the debtor's occupation, circumstances and means of payment as they are known to the applicant? (yes or no)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 42, rule 16(3), is it so that the affidavit states what the Rule requires` IS
    `o 42 r 16(3) the affidavit states what the Rule requires` `the judgment notice is supported by an affidavit` `what the affidavit states as the Rule needs it`
    WHERE
        `what the affidavit states as the Rule needs it` MEANS `o 42 r 16(3) what the affidavit states` WITH
            `o 42 r 16(3)(a) the full name and address of the judgment debtor` IS `the full name and address of the judgment debtor`
            `o 42 r 16(3)(b) the date and particulars of the order for payment in respect of which default has been made` IS `the date and particulars of the order for payment in respect of which default has been made`
            `o 42 r 16(3)(c) the total amount which has been paid since the date of the order for payment` IS `the total amount which has been paid since the date of the order for payment`
            `o 42 r 16(3)(d) the sum or instalment in respect of which default has been made` IS `the sum or instalment in respect of which default has been made`
            `o 42 r 16(3)(e) the date on which the same ought to have been paid according to the order for payment` IS `the date on which the same ought to have been paid according to the order for payment`
            `o 42 r 16(3)(f) the debtor's occupation, circumstances and means of payment as they are known to the applicant` IS `the debtor's occupation, circumstances and means of payment as they are known to the applicant`

