      `where the person under disability is a person lacking capacity, that there is no person authorised as mentioned in sub-paragraph (b)` IS A `Under Order 44, rule 4(6): a statement may be required` @desc what the certificate certifies: which of these applies to where the person under disability is a person lacking capacity, that there is no person authorised as mentioned in sub-paragraph (b)?
      `that the person so named has no interest in the cause or matter in question adverse to that of the person under disability` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the certificate certifies: is it true that that the person so named has no interest in the cause or matter in question adverse to that of the person under disability? (yes or no)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 44, rule 4(6)(c), is it so that the certificate in Form 74 certifies what the Rule requires` IS
    `o 44 r 4(6)(c) the certificate in Form 74 certifies what the Rule requires` `what the certificate certifies as the Rule needs it`
    WHERE
        `what the certificate certifies as the Rule needs it` MEANS `o 44 r 4(6)(c) what the certificate certifies` WITH
            `o 44 r 4(6)(c)(i) that he or she knows or believes (as the case may be) that the person to whom the certificate relates is a minor or a person lacking capacity, giving (in the case of a person lacking capacity) the grounds of his or her knowledge or belief` IS `that he or she knows or believes (as the case may be) that the person to whom the certificate relates is a minor or a person lacking capacity, giving (in the case of a person lacking capacity) the grounds of his or her knowledge or belief`
            `o 44 r 4(6)(c)(ii) where the person under disability is a person lacking capacity, that there is no person authorised as mentioned in sub-paragraph (b)` IS (`Under Orders 39 to 45, my choice for o 44 r 4(6) a statement may be required` `where the person under disability is a person lacking capacity, that there is no person authorised as mentioned in sub-paragraph (b)`)
            `o 44 r 4(6)(c)(iii) that the person so named has no interest in the cause or matter in question adverse to that of the person under disability` IS `that the person so named has no interest in the cause or matter in question adverse to that of the person under disability`

