      `that the person proposed as litigation representative is willing and a proper person to act as such` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the evidence proves: is it true that that the person proposed as litigation representative is willing and a proper person to act as such? (yes or no)
      `that the person proposed as litigation representative has no interest in the proceedings adverse to that of the person under disability` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the evidence proves: is it true that that the person proposed as litigation representative has no interest in the proceedings adverse to that of the person under disability? (yes or no)
      `that the originating claim, originating application, defence and counterclaim or third party notice (as the case may be) was duly served on the person under disability` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the evidence proves: is it true that that the originating claim, originating application, defence and counterclaim or third party notice (as the case may be) was duly served on the person under disability? (yes or no)
      `that notice of the application was so served, or the Court has directed under paragraph (6) that it need not be served` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what the evidence proves: is it true that that notice of the application was so served, or the Court has directed under paragraph (6) that it need not be served? (yes or no)
