            `o 44 r 5(5)(b) that the person proposed as litigation representative has no interest in the proceedings adverse to that of the person under disability` IS `that the person proposed as litigation representative has no interest in the proceedings adverse to that of the person under disability`
            `o 44 r 5(5)(c) that the originating claim, originating application, defence and counterclaim or third party notice (as the case may be) was duly served on the person under disability` IS `that the originating claim, originating application, defence and counterclaim or third party notice (as the case may be) was duly served on the person under disability`
            `o 44 r 5(5)(d) that notice of the application was so served, or the Court has directed under paragraph (6) that it need not be served` IS `that notice of the application was so served, or the Court has directed under paragraph (6) that it need not be served`

