GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 44, rule 13(3), is it so that the Court may order the document to be deemed duly served on the person under disability` IS
    `o 44 r 13(3) the Court may order the document to be deemed duly served on the person under disability` `this Rule applies` `the document has been or is to be served on the person under disability or on a person other than a person mentioned in paragraph (2)`

-- o 44 r 13(4) the requirement of personal service of the document applies
