GIVEN `the document is a judgment or order requiring a person to do, or refrain from doing, any act, a summons for the committal of any person, or an order to attend court issued to any person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the document is a judgment or order requiring a person to do, or refrain from doing, any act, a summons for the committal of any person, or an order to attend court issued to any person? (yes or no)
