§§ `Rule 4 -- My supporting affidavits as claimant (O. 49, r. 4)`

@export Under Order 49, rule 4(1), within how many days of serving the last defendant must the claimants file and serve their supporting affidavits?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under Order 49, rule 4(1), within how many days after service on the last defendant must the claimants serve their affidavits` IS
    `o 49 r 4(1) the period after service of the originating application on the last defendant`'s `period length`

@export Under Order 49, rule 4(1), must the claimants adduce their evidence by affidavit?
GIVEN `my originating application is an application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your originating application an application as Order 49, Rule 1 defines it?
      `the claimants intend to adduce evidence in support` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the claimants intend to adduce evidence in support of the application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 49, rule 4(1), must the claimants adduce their evidence by affidavit` IS
    `o 49 r 4(1) the duty to adduce the evidence by affidavit arises` `my originating application is an application` `the claimants intend to adduce evidence in support`

@export Under Order 49, rule 4(1), have the claimants adduced their evidence by affidavit filed and served in time?
GIVEN `my originating application is an application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your originating application an application as Order 49, Rule 1 defines it?
      `the claimants intend to adduce evidence in support` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the claimants intend to adduce evidence in support of the application?
      `the evidence is adduced by affidavit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the evidence adduced by affidavit?
      `the date the affidavit was filed and a copy served on every defendant` IS A DATE @desc On what date were the affidavit filed and a copy served on every defendant named under Rule 2(2), (3) or (4)?
      `the last day for doing it, counted under Order 3, Rule 3` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day: 14 days after the originating application was served on the last such defendant (the period begins the day after service; if the last day falls on a Saturday, Sunday or public holiday, take the next court day)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 49, rule 4(1), have the claimants adduced their evidence by affidavit in time` IS
    `o 49 r 4(1) the evidence has been adduced by affidavit filed and served in time` `my originating application is an application` `the claimants intend to adduce evidence in support` `the evidence is adduced by affidavit` `the date the affidavit was filed and a copy served on every defendant` `the last day for doing it, counted under Order 3, Rule 3`

@export Under Order 49, rule 4(2)(a), does my affidavit for my section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) application set out everything it must?
GIVEN `the provision of the Act my application is made under` IS A `o 49 r 1 the provision of the Act under which an application is made` @desc Under which provision of the Land Titles (Strata) Act is the application made? One of: section 84A(1) (sale of all the lots and common property in a strata title plan); section 84D(2) (sale of all the flats and the land in a development); section 84E(3) (sale of all the flats and the land in a development); section 84FA(2) (sale of all the lots and common property in a plan to which section 84FA applies); another provision
      `the affidavit is made by or with the authority of all the authorised representatives` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the affidavit made by or with the authority of all the authorised representatives appointed under section 84A(2) in connection with the application?
      `the lots and common property, and the total area and share value of the lots` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the affidavit set out the lots and common property comprised in the strata title plan and the total area and share value of all the lots (excluding any accessory lot) to which the application relates?
      `the date of the latest Temporary Occupation Permit or Certificate of Statutory Completion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the date when the latest Temporary Occupation Permit or Certificate of Statutory Completion was issued for a building (other than common property) in the plan?
      `the share values and areas of the lots, by who has and has not signed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the respective share values of every subsidiary proprietor and the areas of each lot, classified by those who have and those who have not signed the collective sale agreement?
      `the proposed method of distribution of the sale proceeds and the other particulars of the sale` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the proposed method of distribution of sale proceeds under the collective sale agreement and all other particulars of the collective sale?
      `the valuation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the valuation of the lots and common property?
      `whether the agreement involves a redevelopment arrangement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it say whether the sale and purchase agreement involves an arrangement for the redevelopment of the land and, if so, whether it requires a defendant to be a party to it?
      `all particulars of the sale and purchase agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out all particulars of the sale and purchase agreement?
      `the date the permitted time started` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the date that the permitted time (within the meaning of the First Schedule to the Act) for the collective sale agreement started?
      `the date the collective sale agreement was last executed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the date on which the collective sale agreement was last executed by any subsidiary proprietor referred to in section 84A(1) or 84FA(2)?
      `the date or dates the notices were affixed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the date or dates on which the notices referred to in paragraph 1(b) of the First Schedule to the Act were affixed?
      `the particulars of the stop order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the particulars of the stop order issued in relation to the same proposed sale?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 49, rule 4(2)(a), does my affidavit set out everything it must` IS
    `o 49 r 4(2)(a) the affidavit for an application under section 84A(1) or 84FA(2) is as it must be` `the provision of the Act my application is made under` `the affidavit is made by or with the authority of all the authorised representatives` (`o 49 r 4(2)(a) what the affidavit sets out` OF `the lots and common property, and the total area and share value of the lots`, `the date of the latest Temporary Occupation Permit or Certificate of Statutory Completion`, `the share values and areas of the lots, by who has and has not signed`, `the proposed method of distribution of the sale proceeds and the other particulars of the sale`, `the valuation`, `whether the agreement involves a redevelopment arrangement`, `all particulars of the sale and purchase agreement`, `the date the permitted time started`, `the date the collective sale agreement was last executed`, `the date or dates the notices were affixed`, `the particulars of the stop order`)

