      `the flats and land, and the total area of the flats` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the affidavit set out the flats and land comprised in the development and the total area of all the flats to which the application relates?
      `the date of the latest Temporary Occupation Permit or Certificate of Statutory Completion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the date when the latest Temporary Occupation Permit or Certificate of Statutory Completion was issued for a building (other than common property) in the development?
      `the shares or notional shares in land and the areas of the flats, by who has and has not signed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the respective shares or notional shares in land of every proprietor and the areas of each flat, classified by those who have and those who have not signed the collective sale agreement?
      `the proposed method of distribution of the sale proceeds and the other particulars of the sale` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the proposed method of distribution of sale proceeds under the collective sale agreement and all other particulars of the collective sale?
      `the valuation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the valuation of the flats and land?
      `whether the agreement involves a redevelopment arrangement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it say whether the sale and purchase agreement involves an arrangement for the redevelopment of the land and, if so, whether it requires a defendant to be a party to it?
      `all particulars of the sale and purchase agreement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out all particulars of the sale and purchase agreement?
      `the date the permitted time started` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the date the permitted time (within the meaning of the First Schedule to the Act) for the collective sale agreement started?
