      `the Court has otherwise directed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Court otherwise directed?
      `the day in question` IS A DATE @desc On what day do you want to know whether the restraint order is in effect?
      `the day fixed for the hearing with notice of the application` IS A DATE @desc What is the day fixed for the hearing with notice of the application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
