    `o 53 r 12(2) the restraint order has effect until the day fixed for the hearing with notice` `the restraint order was made without notice` `the Court has otherwise directed` `the day in question` `the day fixed for the hearing with notice of the application`

@export Under Order 53, rule 12(3), does the duty to serve and notify arise?
