GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 53, rule 12(3), does the duty to serve and notify arise` IS
    `o 53 r 12(3) the duty to serve and notify arises` `a restraint order has been made`

@export Under Order 53, rule 12(3), have the copies been served and the persons notified as required?
