      `the Court has otherwise provided as to service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Court otherwise provided as to how the order and affidavit are to be served?
      `copies of the order and supporting affidavit are served on the defendant and on all other named persons restrained` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are copies of the order and supporting affidavit served on the defendant and on all other named persons restrained?
      `all other persons or bodies affected by the order are notified of its terms` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are all other persons or bodies affected by the order notified of its terms?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
