    `o 54 r 2(2) the person taking the oath may place the left hand on the Bible or hold it in the manner the person desires` `the person has objected before taking the oath to placing the left hand on the Bible or holding it` `the manner is repugnant to justice or decency` `the manner purports to affect a third person`

