@export Under Order 54, rule 2(3), has the officer administered the oath as the officer must?
GIVEN `it is an oath under the Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it an oath under the Act?
      `the person about to take the oath is permitted under the Act to do otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person about to take the oath permitted under the Act to do otherwise?
      `the person about to take the oath is physically incapable of so taking the oath` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person about to take the oath physically incapable of so taking the oath?
