    `o 54 r 2(3) the officer has administered the oath as the officer must` `it is an oath under the Act` `the person about to take the oath is permitted under the Act to do otherwise` `the person about to take the oath is physically incapable of so taking the oath` `the officer administered the oath in the form and manner set out in paragraph (2)`

