    `o 55 r 2(1) the application is made as it must be` `it is an application for an order under Rule 1` `it is an application for a further order or directions in relation to the same matter after an earlier application` `Rule 3 applies` `it is made without notice` `it is made by a person duly authorised to make it on behalf of the court or tribunal in question` `it is supported by affidavit`

@export Under Order 55, rule 2(2), are the document and any translation exhibited as they must be?
