      `the letter of request, certificate or other document is exhibited` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the letter of request, certificate or other document exhibited?
      `that document is not in the English language` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that document not in the English language?
      `a translation of that document in the English language is exhibited` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a translation of that document in the English language exhibited?
