-- ===========================================================================
§ `Order 56 -- Partners: I am a partner, or I sue or am sued, in the name of a firm`
-- This group arises only if two or more persons sue or are sued as partners in the name of their firm, or an individual is sued in a business name: ask "Does this apply to you?" before showing it.
-- ===========================================================================

§§ `Rule 1 -- Actions by and against firms within jurisdiction (O. 56, r. 1)`

@export Under Order 56, rule 1, what is the least number of persons who may sue or be sued in the name of the firm?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under Order 56, rule 1, what is the least number of persons who may sue or be sued in the name of the firm` IS
    `o 56 r 1 the least number of persons who may sue or be sued in the name of the firm`

@export Under Order 56, rule 1, are there enough persons to sue or be sued in the name of the firm?
GIVEN `the number of persons` IS A NUMBER @desc How many persons claim to be entitled, or are alleged to be liable, as partners in respect of the cause of action?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 56, rule 1, are there enough persons to sue or be sued in the name of the firm` IS
    `o 56 r 1 there are enough persons` `the number of persons`

@export Under Order 56, rule 1, may the persons sue or be sued in the name of the firm?
GIVEN `any written law provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does any written law provide otherwise?
      `the number of persons` IS A NUMBER @desc How many persons claim to be entitled, or are alleged to be liable, as partners in respect of the cause of action?
      `the persons claim to be entitled, or are alleged to be liable, as partners in respect of a cause of action` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the persons claim to be entitled, or are they alleged to be liable, as partners in respect of the cause of action?
      `the persons carry on business within the jurisdiction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the persons carry on business within the jurisdiction?
      `the name is the name of the firm (if any) of which they were partners at the time when the cause of action accrued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the name the name of the firm (if any) of which they were partners at the time when the cause of action accrued?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 56, rule 1, may the persons sue or be sued in the name of the firm` IS
    `o 56 r 1 the persons may sue or be sued in the name of the firm` `any written law provides otherwise` `the number of persons` `the persons claim to be entitled, or are alleged to be liable, as partners in respect of a cause of action` `the persons carry on business within the jurisdiction` `the name is the name of the firm (if any) of which they were partners at the time when the cause of action accrued`

