@export Under Order 68, rule 3(1), is my document entitled as the rule requires?
GIVEN `the document is an originating application to which this Order relates, or an affidavit, notice or other document in those proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the document is an originating application to which this Order relates, or an affidavit, notice or other document in those proceedings?
      `it is entitled in the matter of the VCC in question, or of the VCC on behalf of the sub-fund or sub-funds in question` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that it is entitled in the matter of the VCC in question, or of the VCC on behalf of the sub-fund or sub-funds in question?
      `it is entitled in the matter of the Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that it is entitled in the matter of the Act?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Order 68, rule 3(1), is my document entitled as the rule requires` IS
    `o 68 r 3(1) the document is entitled as the Rule requires` `the document is an originating application to which this Order relates, or an affidavit, notice or other document in those proceedings` `it is entitled in the matter of the VCC in question, or of the VCC on behalf of the sub-fund or sub-funds in question` `it is entitled in the matter of the Act`


