      `the application and supporting affidavit have been served on the Attorney-General` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the application and supporting affidavit have been served on the Attorney-General?
      `the application and supporting affidavit have been served on every other party to the legal proceedings to be instituted or continued` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the application and supporting affidavit have been served on every other party to the legal proceedings to be instituted or continued?
