    `o 70 r 4(2) the person may file and serve the affidavit in reply` `the person was served with an application for permission` `the date on which the affidavit in reply is filed and served` `the last day for doing the act, counted under Order 3, rule 3`

@export Under Order 70, rule 5, did I file and serve the order and the process within the period?
GIVEN `the person is given permission under section 74(1) to institute or continue legal proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that you are given permission under section 74(1) to institute or continue legal proceedings?
      `the date the order, and the process or document, were filed and served on every other party (has this happened yet)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has this happened yet: the date the order, and the process or document, were filed and served on every other party?
      `the date the order, and the process or document, were filed and served on every other party` IS A DATE @desc On what date did this happen: the date the order, and the process or document, were filed and served on every other party? (give any date if it has not happened yet)
      `the last day for doing the act, counted under Order 3, rule 3` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day for filing and serving, counted as Order 3, rule 3 counts it (14 days after the order giving permission, unless it fixes another period)?
