    `sch 4 the fee for this document in the proceedings` 2 "table 1 item 1" `the court system the proceedings are in` `the court level the proceedings are in` `the value of the claim, in dollars` `the number of days (or parts of a day) the hearing lasts` 0 1 0

@export Under schedule 4 part 2 table 3, what hearing fee do I pay in total for a hearing before a Judge sitting in the General Division that lasts this many days?
GIVEN `the court system the proceedings are in` IS A `Court system` @desc Are the proceedings in the Supreme Court or the State Courts?
      `the court level the proceedings are in` IS A `Court level` @desc In which court are the proceedings? (General Division, District Court or Magistrate's Court; for the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal choose that court)
      `the value of the claim, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the value of the claim, in dollars? (0 if it has none or you do not know)
      `the number of days the hearing lasts, counting any part of a day as a day` IS A NUMBER @desc For how many days, counting any part of a day as a day, does the hearing last? (Table 3 charges nothing for the first 3 days, so a hearing of 3 days or fewer owes 0; the fee for a longer hearing is the total of the fee for the fourth day, the fifth day and each later day)
