DECIDE `Under schedule 4 part 2 table 3, what hearing fee do I pay in total for a hearing before a Judge sitting in the General Division that lasts this many days` IS
    `sch 4 part 2 table 3 the hearing fee in the proceedings for a hearing of this many days` `the court system the proceedings are in` `the court level the proceedings are in` `the value of the claim, in dollars` `the number of days the hearing lasts, counting any part of a day as a day`

